== Std.Terminal (r3.88): the screen routines write ANSI sequences through the
== same output as Put, in order. A color still set when Main ends is reset,
== and a hidden cursor shown again: the terminal is given back as found.
Use Std.Terminal

Main :
    ClearScreen
    MoveTo(2, 3)
    SetColor(BrightRed, Blue)
    Put("x")
    ResetColor
    ClearLine
    ShowCursor(False)
    SetColor(Green, Black)
    Flush
    PutLn("y")
;
